  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia HIV Response: Eliminating the AIDS Epidemic in Indonesia by 2030 - Indonesia (01-Jan-2024-31-Dec-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia, HIV, Yayasan Spiritia (Spiritia)This program has the following goals: Elimination HIV and AIDS as a public health risk through achieving the global 95-95-95 targets by 2030. The objectives of this program are: Prevention of new infection by expanding PrEP for KP (MSM, FSW and TG) in at least 95 districts by 2026.  To achieve  95% PLHIV know status by the end of 2026.  To achieve 75% PLHIV on treatment by the end of 2026.  To achieve 68% PLHIV on ART had virally supressed by the end 2026.  To achieve the reduction of the stigma and discrimination to the KPs and PLHIV at the health care settings by the end of 2026</narrative>
  </description>
